 Column name  | Description                                                                              | Values                                                                                                                                
 -------------| -----------------------------------------------                                          |------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
label         | Indicates whether the text is offensive or non-offensive                                 | 0 = non-offensive; 1 = offensive                                                                                                              
target        | Indicates the target community of the text                                               | person = text targets a person; group = text targets a group; women = text targets women; other= no targets mentioned 
rationale     | indicates the rationale spans                                                            | contains spans/segments of text, that explain for why the text either offensive or non-offensive   
text          | Indicates the text                                                                       | This is the text to be classified        
